# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# NEVER COMMIT CLIENT DATA.
#
# If this repo is public (which it must be for GitHub Pages on a free account),
# anything here is world-readable and stays in git history even after deletion.
# Collector holdings, budgets and conversation notes are sensitive personal and
# commercial data under India's DPDP Act. The CRM belongs on a private,
# authenticated backend — never in this repository.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
clients/
crm/
*client*.json
*clients*.csv
*.crm.json
secrets.json
.env
.env.*
credentials*
*token*
*.key
*.pem

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Build state
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# The accumulated auction history. Cached by the workflow between runs rather
# than committed — at 11 MB, a nightly binary commit would add roughly 4 GB of
# git history a year. Rebuild with: workflow_dispatch -> mode: full
data/artdesk.db
data/artdesk.db-wal
data/artdesk.db-shm

# The full derivation (~3.5 MB). Only app_data.json is read by the app, and
# desk.json regenerates from the database in seconds — committing it nightly
# would be pure churn.
data/desk.json

# Run logs
data/*.log

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Local noise
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.venv/
venv/
